It is possible, just unlikely.

When you eat a tengu, first you roll to get teleportation, then
if you fail to get teleportation, you roll to get teleport 
control.  With a level 6 monster (ie: a tengu) you have a 60%
chance of getting teleportation, and a 40% chance of getting
teleport control.

Hence, the odds of NOT getting teleportation and getting teleport
control instead are:

(1-.6)*(.4) = 16%

